{"chars": "And those pockets are full of surprises: seed packets, colored pencils, a magnifying glass, and a little sketchbook filled with drawings of flowers. That's because Mrs. Claus is a botanist. A botanist is a scientist who studies plants: flowers, trees, mosses and all things green and growing. Mrs. Claus knows more about plants than almost anyone in the world. And she has a special rule: when she finds a beautiful flower in the wild, she doesn't pick it. She draws it instead, so the flower can keep on growing.", "start": [0.225, 0.225, 0.225, 0.338, 0.338, 0.338, 0.338, 0.338, 0.338, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.113, 1.113, 1.113, 1.113, 1.113, 1.312, 1.312, 1.312, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 2.325, 2.438, 2.438, 2.438, 2.438, 2.438, 2.75, 2.75, 2.75, 2.75, 2.75, 2.75, 2.75, 2.75, 3.375, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.825, 3.825, 3.825, 3.825, 3.825, 3.825, 3.825, 3.825, 4.55, 4.625, 4.625, 4.725, 4.725, 4.725, 4.725, 4.725, 4.725, 4.725, 4.725, 4.725, 4.725, 4.725, 5.375, 5.375, 5.375, 5.375, 5.375, 5.375, 6.025, 6.1, 6.1, 6.1, 6.1, 6.213, 6.213, 6.263, 6.263, 6.263, 6.263, 6.263, 6.263, 6.263, 6.562, 6.562, 6.562, 6.562, 6.562, 6.562, 6.562, 6.562, 6.562, 6.562, 6.562, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.412, 7.412, 7.412, 7.412, 7.412, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.963, 7.963, 7.963, 8.088, 8.088, 8.088, 8.088, 8.088, 8.088, 8.088, 8.088, 8.95, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.625, 9.625, 9.625, 9.625, 9.625, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 10.275, 10.275, 10.275, 10.387, 10.387, 10.45, 10.45, 10.45, 10.45, 10.45, 10.45, 10.45, 10.45, 10.45, 11.3, 11.412, 11.412, 11.525, 11.525, 11.525, 11.525, 11.525, 11.525, 11.525, 11.525, 11.525, 12.025, 12.025, 12.025, 12.15, 12.15, 12.262, 12.262, 12.262, 12.262, 12.262, 12.262, 12.262, 12.262, 12.262, 12.262, 12.83